            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EAs the holiday season brings both happy traffic spikes and the occasional unwelcome visitor, it\u2019s the perfect time to make sure your website can handle the pressure. This guide walks you through real-world strategies for building DDoS resilience into your Umbraco (or any) site \u2014 from understanding attack layers and optimizing caching to setting up smart firewall rules and throttling policies.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://24days.in/umbraco-cms/2025/ddos-defence-guide/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
